Feature: Refuse newsroom skip-ahead

  Rule: Block configured shortcut transitions
    Scenario: Refuse jumping from idea to research
      Given the issue type is "story"
      When transitioning from "idea" to "research"
      Then the issue must have label "assignment-complete"

    Scenario: Refuse jumping from idea to copywriting
      Given the issue type is "story"
      When transitioning from "idea" to "copywriting"
      Then the issue must have label "editor-selected"

    Scenario: Refuse jumping from research to copywriting
      Given the issue type is "story"
      When transitioning from "research" to "copywriting"
      Then the issue must have label "editor-selected"

  Rule: Coach against skip-ahead while inspecting
    Scenario: Remind while viewing an idea
      Given the issue type is "story"
      Given the issue status is "idea"
      When viewing an issue
      Then warn "Do not skip newsroom stages."
      Then explain "The ladder is idea → assignment → research → report → editor select → copywriting → published. Hooks refuse skip-ahead and missing artifacts."
